# Automatic feature commits

After a task is verified, stage and commit before ending the turn. Do not ask whether to commit.

- One logical feature or fix per commit. Split unrelated changes.
- Use Conventional Commits in the past tense (`feat:`, `fix:`, `chore:`).
- Do not commit secrets (`.env`, credentials).
- Do not push unless the user asks.
